<section class="hero"><div class="hero-inner"><span class="hero-tag">Ethical &amp; Moral Concerns</span><h1>Ethics</h1><p>Tracking ethical, moral, and labor concerns for the Durham, NC area and beyond.</p></div></section>
<section class="section"><div class="section-inner"><h2>Ethical Concerns Database</h2><div class="table-wrap"><table>
<thead><tr><th>#</th><th>Concern Area</th><th>Description</th></tr></thead>
<tbody>
<tr><td>1</td><td>Fair Wages</td><td>Ensuring all workers receive fair compensation for labor performed</td></tr>
<tr><td>2</td><td>Worker Dignity</td><td>Treating all employees with respect regardless of position or background</td></tr>
<tr><td>3</td><td>Safe Conditions</td><td>Maintaining workplaces free from hazards and health risks</td></tr>
<tr><td>4</td><td>Equal Opportunity</td><td>Non-discriminatory hiring, promotion, and retention practices</td></tr>
<tr><td>5</td><td>Whistleblower Protection</td><td>Safeguarding those who report illegal or unethical workplace activities</td></tr>
<tr><td>6</td><td>Environmental Responsibility</td><td>Ethical obligation of businesses toward environmental stewardship</td></tr>
<tr><td>7</td><td>Community Impact</td><td>Business decisions that affect local community welfare and development</td></tr>
<tr><td>8</td><td>Transparency</td><td>Open and honest communication with workers and the public</td></tr>
<tr><td>9</td><td>Child Protection</td><td>Preventing exploitation of minors in any labor capacity</td></tr>
<tr><td>10</td><td>Intellectual Honesty</td><td>Truthfulness in reporting, data, and public communications</td></tr>
<tr><td>11</td><td>Right to Organize</td><td>Workers' right to form unions and collectively bargain</td></tr>
<tr><td>12</td><td>Healthcare Access</td><td>Employer obligation to support worker health and medical needs</td></tr>
<tr><td>13</td><td>Anti-Retaliation</td><td>Protecting workers from punishment for exercising legal rights</td></tr>
<tr><td>14</td><td>Privacy</td><td>Respecting employee privacy in monitoring, data collection, and personal affairs</td></tr>
<tr><td>15</td><td>Social Responsibility</td><td>Corporate duty to contribute positively to society</td></tr>
</tbody></table></div></div></section>
